== Title / identity audit ==

Two provisional backlog titles were normalized during Phase 1:

* [[Predicate logic]] → [[First-order logic]]
* [[Consistency]] → [[Consistency (logic)]]

The first change makes the intended formal boundary explicit: first-order quantification over individuals rather than an ambiguous “predicate logic” umbrella.

The second prevents collision with durable non-logical notions of consistency in databases, distributed systems, data, behavior, and ordinary language.

No duplicate [[Inference]] page was created because [[Inference]] is already canonical from Wave 2.

